[1m[38;5;231mWhich triggers should fire a notification?[0m

  [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;114m[✔][39m Due soon
  [38;5;246mFires at a lead time before the due date (e.g. 1 hour, 1 day). Needs a configurable threshold.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m [38;5;114m[✔][39m Overdue
  [38;5;246mFires once when a task passes its due date while still incomplete. Cheapest and most obviously useful.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m [ ] Went stale
  [38;5;246mFires when an incomplete task hasn't been touched in N days. Needs updatedAt and a staleness window.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m [ ] Explicit reminder
  [38;5;246mA per-task 'remind me at <time>' independent of the due date. Most control, most UI.[39m
  [38;5;246m5. [39m[ ] [38;5;246mType something[39m
